	(text "CP2108-B03, bus-powered. VREGIN = VBUS, internal LDO -> VIO_3V3; VIO/VIOHD on VIO_3V3\nVBUS sense divider; ~{RESET} 1k pull-up\n4x UART with RTS/CTS to hierarchy; DTR/DSR/DCD/RI and GPIO left NC\nB02 revision is obsolete - order B03 only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 48.26 0)
		(effects
